---
// FAQ Accordion section matching exact questions and answers
---

<section id="faq" class="bg-[#FBFAF7] py-24" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:d8i857">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsdq">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsdr">
      <!-- Left Column (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsds">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#F5F3ED] border border-[#E8E4DA] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-muted-foreground uppercase px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsdt">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EC5A00]" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6maa"></span>
          FAQ
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-[36px] sm:text-[48px] font-semibold text-[#09090b] tracking-[-1.2px] leading-tight mt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:akmkwk">
          Quick answers, <span class="italic text-[#EC5A00]" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mab">no jargon.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-muted-foreground mt-4 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jidy6x">
          Something not listed here? Send a message and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column (7 cols) - Accordion -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsdu">
        <div class="bg-[#F5F3ED] border border-[#E8E4DA] rounded-2xl divide-y divide-[#E8E4DA] overflow-hidden shadow-2xs" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:o9dsdv">
          <!-- Item 1 (open by default) -->
          <details class="group p-6" open>
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-heading font-semibold text-[17px] text-[#09090b] select-none">
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mac">Do you offer same-day emergency appliance repair?</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-light text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-200" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mad">
                +
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jidy6y">
              Yes. For urgent failures — like a refrigerator or freezer that has stopped cooling — we offer same-day emergency service across the Tri-Cities. Call us at (509) 300-4042 and we'll dispatch a technician as quickly as possible.
            </p>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 2 -->
          <details class="group p-6">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-heading font-semibold text-[17px] text-[#09090b] select-none">
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mae">How much does an appliance repair cost?</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-light text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-200" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6maf">
                +
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jidy6z">
              Every repair starts with a diagnostic visit that covers the technician's assessment. Before any work begins we give you a clear, upfront repair price — you approve the cost first. No hidden fees, no surprises.
            </p>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 3 -->
          <details class="group p-6">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-heading font-semibold text-[17px] text-[#09090b] select-none">
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb1">What appliance brands do you service?</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-light text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-200" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb2">
                +
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jidy70">
              We service all major brands including Bosch, GE, LG, Samsung, Whirlpool, KitchenAid, Maytag, Frigidaire, Amana, Electrolux, Kenmore, Jenn-Air, Sub-Zero, Viking and more — plus older models other companies turn away.
            </p>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 4 -->
          <details class="group p-6">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-heading font-semibold text-[17px] text-[#09090b] select-none">
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb3">What areas do you serve?</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-light text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-200" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb4">
                +
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:57mrxo">
              We serve Richland, Pasco, Kennewick, West Richland, Burbank, Riverview and the surrounding Tri-Cities area — with no rural surcharges or hidden travel fees.
            </p>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 5 -->
          <details class="group p-6">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-heading font-semibold text-[17px] text-[#09090b] select-none">
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb5">Do you repair both homes and businesses?</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-light text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-200" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:jy6mb6">
                +
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground mt-3 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/FaqSection.astro:57mrxp">
              Yes. We work with homeowners, landlords and small businesses — including restaurants, hotels and retail operations that need commercial refrigeration, kitchen equipment and laundry machines repaired fast.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
